:: story.paintingWhatIs
{=

(storylet: when
    $story's lock does not contain "story.paintingWhatIs"
)

(metadata:
"title", "That Thing in the Corner",
)

($funcMainContent:[{<!--?mainReading-->

It appears to be a ($funcReveal: "curtained window.", "curtain")|curtain)[ Or maybe a shower.]

|curtain)[
<br>
A metal rack is installed about ten feet up the wall. Hanging from it is a makeshift curtain made up of a translucent material - you want to say glassine, but perhaps butcher's paper - veiling ($funcReveal: "whatever that is inside", "what") from ($funcReveal: "the world", "notReady"), and more importantly, preventing ($funcReveal: "you", "you") from staring at it all day long.
]

|what)[
<br>
($funcReveal: "//What// is behind this veil?", "painting")
]

|painting)[
<br>
Art.
]

<!--trigger for ?yesBut-->
(set: _triggerYesBut to ($funcChainTrigger: "paintingQuestions", 3, "yesBut"))

|painting)[
<br>
($funcReveal: "A portrait?", "portrait")
]

|portrait)[_triggerYesBut
<br>
Perhaps. Grasping in the fog of your mind, you dimly recall a girl - //Katherine//, of radiant skin - who must have been the spark, only a small one, for the kindling had already been laid.
<br>
No, if you were to lift this veil, you would not recognize her face, nor single person's. Faces are but meat. Muses are pure light.
]

|painting)[
<br>
($funcReveal: "A landscape?", "landscape")
]

|landscape)[_triggerYesBut
<br>
You had thought of a certain shore of a certain lake, but that was so long ago, and all lakes shine with the same stars. But //this// star... no dirt nor water on Earth should ever see a light so terrible.
]

|painting)[
<br>
($funcReveal: "A still life?", "stillLife")
]

|stillLife)[_triggerYesBut
<br>
Still: but not dead, only sleeping. Life: a greater kind, or a mimicry thereof, a pale reminder to all that lives that there may be more after the end. 
]

|yesBut)[
<br>
($funcReveal: "Yes, but what //is// it?", "sun")
]

|sun)[The Sun. It is a painting of ($funcReveal: "the Sun.", "mainDone")]

|notReady)[
<br>
It longs to meet the world.
]

|you)[
<br>
Your Work is not yet done. It is calling out to you.
]



}],
[{<!--?mainDone-->

<!--just in case those 2 haven't shown-->
(t8n: "dissolve")(show: ?notReady)
(t8n: "dissolve")(show: ?you)

<!--link-->
($funcOutLink: "Approach it.", "Warm, like skin.", "paint.start", [{
    <!--lock-->
    ($funcLock: (passage:)'s name)
}])

}],
false)